<title>FRANCE: Estimated breakdown of French EU grain bids.</title>
<headline>Estimated breakdown of French EU grain bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders gave the following estimated, cumulative breakdown of bids for free-market grain placed through France at Thursday's weekly European tender.</p>
<p>		 -- WHEAT --</p>
<p>  Cumulative volume     Maximum refund</p>
<p>    (tonnes)		 (Ecus/tonne)</p>
<p>     3,000		     8.49</p>
<p>   126,000		     9.95</p>
<p>   166,000		    11.00</p>
<p>   196,000		    11.95</p>
<p>   266,000		    12.95</p>
<p>   334,000		    13.97</p>
<p>   454,000		    15.00</p>
<p>   624,000		    19.90</p>
<p>		 -- BARLEY --</p>
<p>    25,000		    31.00</p>
<p>   177,000		    34.75</p>
<p>   281,000		    35.00</p>
<p>   386,000		    36.00</p>
<p>   636,000		    39.97</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
